message: "If you use these datasets in your research, please cite:"
type: dataset
title: "MechanicsDSL Physics Datasets"
abstract: >
  Reference datasets for physics parameter estimation and inverse problem
  benchmarking. Includes synthetic datasets with known ground-truth parameters
  generated from MechanicsDSL forward simulations with Gaussian observation noise.
